# DRONE VOICES' HOLDS (K4): a swell stays up that many bars from its start, so it falls on a bar line; a held
# voice lets go that many bars after it came in. 90 BPM: a bar 2.7 s. Voice 1 held, letting go after 2 bars;
# voice 2 swelling every 4 bars, holding 2 bars (longer than its own few seconds: still up at 4.5 s)
autoplay 0
wait 300
dswell 0
tap ENV
turn SELECT 20
expect page 12
turn K4 2
expect dthold1 2
turn K1 1
turn K2 3
turn K4 2
expect dtcyc2 2
expect dthold2 2
shot drone_holds.png
tap HOME
tap SEQ
wait 1000
expect playing 1
expect drone1 1
expect drone2 1
wait 3500
expect drone1 1
expect drone2 1
wait 2000
expect drone1 0
expect drone2 0
wait 5000
expect drone2 1
expect drone1 0